{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17209190","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17209190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1720919001:1":{"text":"こんにちは、『サバンナ・デイリー』の記者を務めるヘデルと申します。少し調査にご協力いただきたいのですが……","source_cn":"这位先生，日安。我是《赛凡纳晨报》的实习记者赫蒂奇，正...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x191F5A562A6A8796","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720919002:1":{"text":"ん？記者？どのような調査でしょう……","source_cn":"啊？记者？社会调查？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5C8E5CCB3E88A1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720919003:1":{"text":"はい！では率直にお聞きします。最近、ディミトリ邸の近くで怪しい人物を見かけませんでしたか？","source_cn":"是的！请问您最近在德米特子爵府邸周围，有没有见过什么可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC14AE8DC76CC4C43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720919004:1":{"text":"怪しい人物？","source_cn":"可疑的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45C5F3FC84F58B77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720919005:1":{"text":"例えば、邸宅の様子をこそこそうかがっているような人物です。それから、遠い親戚を名乗る人物とか、明らかに変装してる人物とか……","source_cn":"比如，有没有那种鬼鬼祟祟、四处探听消息的神秘人？或者，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2CDE3247CAF7BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720919006:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720919007:1":{"text":"よく思い出してください！最近、ディミトリ子爵の様子をしつこく聞かれるようなことはなかったですか？邸宅の警備状況に異常な関心を示した者は！？","source_cn":"您仔细想想，有没有人向您打听过德米特子爵的日常起居？或...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8CF6E1F4EF1883A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720919008:1":{"text":"お嬢さん、どうしてそんなことを聞くのですか？変装だの、邸宅の警備状況だの……","source_cn":"小姐，你问这些做什么？又是探听消息，又是乔装打扮……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8D316CBD223C7E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720919009:1":{"text":"あなたのほうが、よほど怪しいのですが……","source_cn":"我看……你就挺可疑的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A0B82EF01C0EA3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720919010:1":{"text":"えっ！？ち、違います……私はただ調査をしてるだけです！","source_cn":"哎？！我、我不是……我只是在做调查！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8B25E403D03126E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720919011:1":{"text":"……最近は詐欺の手口も多様化してると聞きますからね。帰ってください、さもないと守備軍を呼びますよ！","source_cn":"哼，现在的骗子花样可真多。离我远点！不然我就叫守备军了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28FF7BB293C83541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:实习记者赫蒂奇":{"text":"見習い記者のヘデル","source":"实习记者赫蒂奇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:谨慎的管家":{"text":"慎重な執事","source":"谨慎的管家","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":2}}